# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Trajectories and Stage A caches
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Input trajectories are large (the reference run is 1.6 GB) and are inputs, not
# source. Caches and their sidecars are reproducible from a trajectory with
# `coana precompute`, so they are build artefacts. Keep both out, and record how
# a cache was made in the commit message or a script instead.
*.pdb
*.gro
*.xtc
*.trr
*.npz
*.coanapure-index.npz
*_offsets.npz

# Small fixtures are the exception: a test needs its inputs in the repo.
!tests/**/*.pdb
!tests/**/*.gro
!tests/**/*.npz

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Generated reports and figures
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Every one of these is emitted by `coana report`, `coana timeline`, the
# acceptance notebook or the docs builders. Regenerating them is one command;
# versioning multi-megabyte HTML makes every diff unreadable.
/GUIDE.html
/CoAnaPure_Analysis_Report.html
/LINEAGE_TIMELINE.html
/REPORT_*.html
/interactive_*.html
notebooks/out_acceptance/
docs/lineage_timeline/out/
docs/fragment_tracking_eval/out/

# Markdown reports are small and reviewable, so they stay tracked:
#   REPORT_*.md, CLEAN_RUN.md, GUIDE.md, README.md

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Notebook noise
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
.ipynb_checkpoints/
# Executed notebooks carry their output cells, which is why two of them are
# ~7 MB. Strip outputs before committing (nbstripout, or Kernel > Restart and
# Clear Output) rather than ignoring the notebooks themselves.

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Python
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.egg-info/
build/
dist/
.eggs/
.pytest_cache/
.coverage
.coverage.*
htmlcov/
.tox/
.nox/
.mypy_cache/
.ruff_cache/

# Virtual environments
.venv/
venv/
env/
ENV/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Editors and OS
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
*~
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# HPC / batch leftovers
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
slurm-*.out
*.sbatch.log
core.*
